for the things they say and the things they do,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:33.420
and to demand transparency and honesty. And it&nbsp;
would be really difficult to completely eliminate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:41.460
lying in politics. But we have a situation right&nbsp;
now where voters are as welcoming as ever of lies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:48.240
If they further what those voters already believe&nbsp;
should be what our elected officials are doing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

